{"id":1750649,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-17T11:47:32.020Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1750649,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Kembali Kepada Fitrah","overview":"# Kembali Kepada Fitrah  The story follows a single mother named Latifah who always hopes for the presence of her stepchildren every time Hari Raya arrives. Four stepchildren namely Hisyam, Juita, Farina and Amri, after the death of her husband, have grown up and lived their own lives. Her waiting continues for 10 years but goes unfulfilled. She remains undeterred and hopes that her wish becomes reality. Her stepchildren have ignored her all this time because they heard false stories. The return of her eldest stepchild, Hisyam, meets with her and successfully heals the longing that has been buried after so long without meeting. Hisyam is shocked after hearing stories from Aunt Enon that for 10 years his younger siblings have not returned to the village to visit their mother who is busy preparing for Hari Raya to welcome them. Hisyam goes to Kuala Lumpur to meet his three siblings and asks them to celebrate Hari Raya again together with their mother like they once did.","popularity":0.0357,"poster_path":"/aFnWQq3hB7K5zc4mblMV0iWBu6j.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2016-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Kembali Kepada Fitrah","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1284234,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Haliza Misbun","original_name":"Haliza Misbun","popularity":0.5914,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a81a386985ac65329891929","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3606377,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Nadia Hassan","orig